{"version":1,"content":"<p>比特幣跌至兩年多來的最低水平，從特朗普再次當選後備受市場追捧的資產，進一步轉變為更廣泛投機性押注退潮的受害者。這種最早的加密貨幣周五在美國下跌6%，周六在亞洲又下跌5.7%，至55533美元，為2024年9月以來最低水平。比特幣自2025年10月升至超過126，000美元的峯值以來，已下跌超過一半，目前價格甚至低於支持加密貨幣的特朗普重返白宮時的水平。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587374.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.704819+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:11:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"53e05847c5e4fe318ceb99e41aaab0c5e655ab83a8ea22ee93e86c20fa7c77f9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}